  <section class="belowfold belowfold--rule" aria-labelledby="d2-kratom-{{ section.id }}">
    <div class="kcard" data-copy-status="aggressive-draft">
      <span class="kcard__pill">Okay, but what is kratom?</span>
      <h2 class="kcard__title" id="d2-kratom-{{ section.id }}">A fair question. Here’s the straight answer.</h2>
      <p class="kcard__lead">Kratom is a leaf from <b>Mitragyna speciosa</b>, a Southeast Asian tree in the coffee family, brewed and chewed there for centuries for <b>steady energy, a lifted mood, and physical ease</b>. How it feels varies person to person. That’s exactly why every Dandy gummy is portioned to an exact 35&nbsp;mg, and why we say start with one.</p>
      <div class="kcard__row">
        <div class="kcard__facts">
          <div class="kcard__chips">
            <span class="kchip">{{ d2_gcheck }}Coffee-family botanical</span>
            <span class="kchip">{{ d2_gcheck }}Centuries of traditional use</span>
            <span class="kchip">{{ d2_gcheck }}Lab-screened every batch</span>
          </div>
          <p class="kcard__more"><a href="{{ url_kratom }}">The full kratom guide →</a></p>
