  {% comment %} ---------- 8. FAQ (fear-ordered) ---------- {% endcomment %}
  <section class="belowfold belowfold--rule" aria-labelledby="d2-faq-{{ section.id }}">
    <div class="belowfold__inner belowfold__inner--narrow">
      <p class="steplabel">Straight answers</p>
      <h2 class="belowfold__title" id="d2-faq-{{ section.id }}">The questions people actually ask.</h2>
      <div class="faq">
        <details><summary>Is kratom legal?</summary><p>Kratom is legal in 34 states. We don’t ship to the other 16, <a href="{{ url_ship }}">here’s the list</a>, checked before you ever reach checkout.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Will I feel weird?</summary><p>Effects vary by person, food, and amount. That’s why every gummy is exactly 35 mg and why we say start with one and wait. You set the gear, the label sets the cap.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Will I fail a drug test?</summary><p>Kratom’s alkaloids aren’t screened on standard panels, but specialized tests exist. If testing matters in your life, we can’t promise a result, nobody honestly can.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Is it tested? What’s actually in it?</summary><p>Every batch is screened by an independent lab, identity, mitragynine potency, heavy metals, microbials, and every pouch carries its batch number. <a href="{{ url_coa }}">Read this batch’s report</a>.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Who shouldn’t take Dandy?</summary><p>Anyone under 21, anyone pregnant or nursing, and anyone on medication without talking to their clinician first. And we can’t ship to 18 states, <a href="{{ url_ship }}">check yours</a>. Start with one gummy; the label is the guide.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Can I become dependent on kratom?</summary><p>Regular daily use can build tolerance and habit. That’s real, it’s on our label, and it’s why the serving guidance says start low and take breaks, not “make it a routine.”</p></details>
        <details><summary>How does the subscription work?</summary><p>$47.99 charged today, $47.99 every 30 days, the first charge equals every renewal charge. Skip, pause, or cancel anytime, self-serve or with one email.</p></details>
        <details><summary>What if it’s not for me?</summary><p class="guarantee" data-copy-status="pending-legal">30-day money-back guarantee</p></details>
